{"parse": {"title": "Mugger", "pageid": 12591, "revid": 15350646, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs|rsc}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|version1 = Regular\n|version2 = Varlamore\n|name = Mugger\n|image1 = [[File:Mugger.png|120px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Mugger (Varlamore).png|120px]]\n|release1 = [[4 January]] [[2001]]\n|release2 = [[20 March]] [[2024]]\n|update1 = Runescape beta is now online!\n|update2 = Varlamore: Part One\n|members = No\n|combat = 6\n|size = 1\n|examine = He jumps out and attacks people.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 1\n|aggressive = Yes\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Crush]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|hitpoints = 8\n|att = 5\n|str = 5\n|def = 5\n|mage = 1\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = -21\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 0\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id1 = 513,1461,6996\n|id2 = 13282\n}}\n[[File:Mugger chathead.png|left]]\n'''Muggers''' are weak human criminals that have a [[combat level]] of 6. Because of their low combat level, they are generally more of a nuisance, but they can still be a threat for brand-new players.\n\nMuggers are [[Aggressiveness|aggressive]], which means that they attack players who are two times the mugger's combat level or less. Thus, muggers are aggressive against players who have a [[Combat level|combat level]] 12 or under\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location=[[Port Sarim jail]] (only drops bones)\n|levels = 6\n|members = No\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:3018,y:3189\n|mtype=pin\n|leagueRegion = Asgarnia\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location = [[South-west Varrock mine]] (in front of Champions' Guild)\n|levels = 6\n|members = No\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:3175,y:3361\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|levels = 6\n|location = Behind [[Lumbridge Castle]] near the [[Lumbridge Swamp]]\n|members = No\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:3181,y:3216\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|levels=6\n|location=Entrance to the [[Asgarnian Ice Dungeon]]\n|members = No\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:2994,y:9582|x:2997,y:9578|x:2992,y:9573|x:2990,y:9578\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Asgarnia\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location = Just outside of the [[Phoenix Gang]] hideout in [[Varrock]]\n|levels = 6\n|members = No\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:3249,y:3391\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\n\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location = North-east of the [[Vinery]]\n|levels = 6\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:1825,y:3573\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Kourend\n}}\n\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location = [[Port Piscarilius]]\n|levels = 6\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:1774,y:3740|x:1835,y:3730\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Kourend\n}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Mugger\n|location = [[Outer Fortis]]\n|levels = 6\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = -1\n|plane = 0\n|x:1698,y:3067\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Varlamore\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n* [[Shaman Caves]] (Possible encounter when smashing [[Barrel (Shaman Caves)|barrels]])\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes}}\n\n{{Average drop value}}\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes and ammunition===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze bolts|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=2-12|rarity=27/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mind rune|quantity=9|rarity=3/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=6|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=5|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Herbs===\n{{HerbDropTableInfo|13/128}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{HerbDropLines|13/128|f2p=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Coins===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|namenotes={{(f)}}|quantity=10|rarity=13/128|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Only dropped in [[free-to-play]]</ref>}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=5|rarity=12/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=15|rarity=3/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=25|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Rope|quantity=1|rarity=40/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|rarity=13/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Knife|quantity=1|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Fishing bait|quantity=1|rarity=6/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Copper ore|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze med helm|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Cabbage|quantity=1|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=beginner|rarity=1/80}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=easy|rarity=1/128|f2p=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops (Plain)==\n''Only found in [[Port Sarim jail]].''\n\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{hastranscript|speaksin}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 4 March 2026\n|update = Cow Boss and Skill Guide & Level-Up Changes\n|change = The mugger in south-east Varrock was readded.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 18 February 2026\n|update = 25th Anniversary Event: 25 Years, 25 Mementos!\n|change = The mugger in south-east Varrock was temporarily removed for the [[25th Anniversary event]].\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 9 July 2007\n|update = A bird in the hand...\n|change = The NPC was graphically updated again.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 26 September 2005\n|update = New graphics for Port Sarim, Rimmington and Thurgo's Peninsula\n|change = The NPC was graphically updated with the rework of Port Sarim.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 6 December 2004\n|update = Various Small Changes.\n|change = The NPC was graphically updated.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n===Gallery (historical)===\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Mugger (historical v1).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mugger (historical v2).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mugger (historical v3).png|center|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Mugger.png|center|300x150px]]\n|-\n|29 March 2004 –<br/>6 December 2004\n|6 December 2004 –<br/>26 September 2005\n|26 September 2005 –<br/>9 July 2007\n|9 July 2007 –<br/>present\n|}\n\n==Trivia==\n*According to the [[Varrock Census]], [[Phearthee Levalsyx]] is the name of the Mugger who resides in the city.\n** His name is a pun on \"Fear the level six\", a reference to his level and the fact he is aggressive and will harm new players.\n* During the [[25th Anniversary event]], the mugger in south-east [[Varrock]] was removed as so to not interfere with players doing the event.\n\n{{Asgarnian Ice Dungeon}}\n{{2017 Birthday event}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T06:17:01.348288+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Bones\" title=\"Bones\"><img alt=\"Bones.png: Mugger drops Bones with rarity Always in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Bones.png?3fbd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"26\" data-file-height=\"19\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/w/Bones\" title=\"Bones\">Bones</a></td><td data-sort-value=\"1\">1</td><td data-sort-value=\"1\" class=\"table-bg-blue\"><span>Always</span></td><td data-so